  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pathways of Peace and Development - Environment Mechanism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen the capacity of institutions and civil society to reverse tropical forest loss in Colombia in the context of peacebuilding (outcome) by accelerating actions of the peace and environment agenda. The goal is to provide flexible and strategic support to government institutions, civil society and communities to carry out actions that promote forest conservation. This outcome has been included in the program &quot;Pathways of Peace and Development&quot; which aims to contribute to the consolidation of peace in Colombia forward and to overcome the country&apos;s armed conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
